id: ultra-divine-water
name: Ultra Divine Water
kind: gear
tags: food
# "You can spend 1 Action to consume this Basic Item."
placeCost: 1
# Its Details. Consumable: "destroyed once it is used".
details: food, consumable
# "Make a Corporeal check against a DC of 10 (increased by double your base Tier of Power)."
gambleSave: corporeal
gambleDC: 10
gamblePerTier: 2
# Made: "have your Life and Ki Points set to their respective maximums". The Awakening is not
# here yet: the card says it.
consumeNote: gains a stack of the Unlocked Potential Awakening as a Level 1 Temporary Awakening
source: Core Rule
description: >
  Drink it for an Action and make a Corporeal Check against DC 10 plus double your base Tier of
  Power: made, Life and Ki full and a Temporary Awakening; failed, Defeated - and dying.
text: >
  Ultra Divine Water:
  –Details: Food, Consumable
  –Effects: You can spend 1 Action to consume this Basic Item. If you do, make a Corporeal check
  against a DC of 10 (increased by double your base Tier of Power – so, at ToP1, the DC would be
  12, 14 at ToP2, etc). If you succeed, you gain a stack of the Unlocked Potential Awakening as a
  Level 1 Temporary Awakening and have your Life and Ki Points set to their respective maximums.
  If you fail, your Life Points are set to their minimum value and you are Defeated. If outside of
  a Combat Encounter, you die immediately, but if not, then you will die if you remain Defeated at
  the end of that Combat Encounter.

---

# --- What the system does ---------------------------------------------------------------------
#
# Consume: 1 Action, and it is used up. A card states the DC - 10 plus twice the drinker's base
# Tier of Power - and the Corporeal Saving Throw is rolled from the sheet. The card has two
# buttons. Made: Life and Ki to their maximums, and the card says the Awakening. Failed: Life to
# nothing (Defeated), and the card says the death - at once outside a Combat Encounter, or at its
# end if still Defeated.
#
# --- What is not built -------------------------------------------------------------------------
#
# The Unlocked Potential Awakening, and Temporary Awakenings: Transformations are not in this
# system yet. And there is no record of being dead apart from being Defeated: the dying is the
# table's.
